  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure 3.4.1. 'Semantic Governance Infrastructure' in three bands. Governance services: LIMR, profile authoring, conformance resources and a governance terminology management service fed by 'Global Content Sources' through content syndication. Runtime services: a runtime terminology service linked to the governance TMS. Content and application layers: implementation guides (IG 1, IG 2, IG 3, …) and applications or use cases (App 1, App 2, App 3, …).",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
